OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying dry
OL,6,Fwith lengthy clear skies this evening
OL,7,Fand overnight. Temperatures will fall
OL,8,Fsharply to allow a widespread frost to
OL,9,Fdevelop, generally colder than on
OL,10,FSaturday night. Breezy at first,
OL,11,Feasing overnight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FA calm and frosty morning.
OL,14,FThough there will be sunny spells, the
OL,15,Fsunshine will often be dimmed by high-
OL,16,Fcloud. Dry and cold throughout the day
OL,17,Fand breezy in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
